  "bodyHash": "ed2b701cf0081977",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>洞穴灯</h1>\n<p>此模组添加了“洞穴灯”方块。这是一种专为洞穴探险设计的光源。它可以放置在地板、墙壁上，或悬挂于天花板。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_72625db6-1202-4e3e-8e06-604163fea2da.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p>它也可以放置在水下，但无法放置在流动的水中。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e1fb9ec6-0cc9-4d8a-a3f9-5243dcbe7f23.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<p>其合成配方包含煤炭、铜锭与紫水晶碎片。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fc8261ee-7e23-4e1e-91d6-534f4e479e6d.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
